{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項塵封多年的蘋果內部設計近日重見天日。在人工智能和模擬器技術的幫助下，一款從未正式發佈過的iPhone多任務界面被成功恢復運行，讓外界得以首次近距離觀察蘋果在iOS 4開發時期曾考慮採用的另一套交互方案。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586296.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.549413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:09:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.620331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.620331+00:00","content_hash":"39da03d7055f0601add3f4138c7f050c5d70bc3b03e3df5cd3a68852d2ae5ab9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}